Source: scenefx
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), meson, ninja-build, pkg-config,
 libwayland-dev, wayland-protocols, libdrm-dev, libxkbcommon-dev,
 libpixman-1-dev, wlroots (>= 0.20), libgbm-dev, libegl-dev,
 libgles-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/wlrfx/scenefx

Package: scenefx
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Wayland compositor effects library (for wlroots 0.20)
 scenefx provides blur, shadow and animation effects for
 wlroots-based compositors. Built against the wlroots package
 from this same repository.
